## Services

Service to the software engineering research community: organizing and program
committees, and peer reviewing for conferences and journals.

I was awarded **Distinguished Reviewer** of the Research Track of the
XXXIX Brazilian Symposium on Software Engineering (SBES 2025), by the
Brazilian Computer Society (SBC) and its Special Committee on Software
Engineering.

